18\\},\\{15,21\\},\\,____\\,\\}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $X$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $X$ where every element of $X$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nTo find the subset that goes in the blank, we must identify which elements of $X$ are not yet contained within any of the given subsets.\n\nLet's go through each element of $X$ and check:\n\n- $3$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $6\\in \\{6,12,18\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $9$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $12\\in \\{6,12,18\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $15\\in \\{15,21\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $18\\in \\{6,12,18\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $21\\in \\{15,21\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $24$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\nThe elements $3,$ $9,$ and $24$ are not yet contained within any of the given subsets. Therefore, the subset that must go in the blank is $\\{3,9,24\\}.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186394003 :answer-field/correct "answer-d6588761-e712-55ae-b522-5cf744904944" :answer-field/choices ["answer-cbb08ac5-bead-556e-a187-3e8d67b3f1ef" "answer-94cac92e-931d-5b78-b781-878cd9109aed" "answer-d6588761-e712-55ae-b522-5cf744904944" "answer-b7479246-87c3-59d8-8b6c-7a38dff2995e" "answer-37c68a76-b066-55eb-9a58-b99e8b5dfc69"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cbb08ac5-bead-556e-a187-3e8d67b3f1ef" :answer/id #uuid "cbb08ac5-bead-556e-a187-3e8d67b3f1ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{12,24\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-94cac92e-931d-5b78-b781-878cd9109aed" :answer/id #uuid "94cac92e-931d-5b78-b781-878cd9109aed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{3,12,24\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d6588761-e712-55ae-b522-5cf744904944" :answer/id #uuid "d6588761-e712-55ae-b522-5cf744904944" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{3,9,24\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b7479246-87c3-59d8-8b6c-7a38dff2995e" :answer/id #uuid "b7479246-87c3-59d8-8b6c-7a38dff2995e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{3,9\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-37c68a76-b066-55eb-9a58-b99e8b5dfc69" :answer/id #uuid "37c68a76-b066-55eb-9a58-b99e8b5dfc69" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{6,15\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186371506 :question/problem "Consider the set $X=\\{0,1,2,3,…,10\\}.$ Which subset must be placed into the blank in the set below so that it represents a partition of $X?$\n\n$$\n\\{\\{2,3,5,7\\},\\{0,1\\},\\,\\{4,8\\},\\,____\\,\\}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $X$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $X$ where every element of $X$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nTo find the subset that goes in the blank, we must identify which elements of $X$ are not yet contained within any of the given subsets.\n\nLet's go through each element of $X$ and check:\n\n- $0\\in \\{0,1\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $1\\in \\{0,1\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $2\\in \\{2,3,5,7\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $3\\in \\{2,3,5,7\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $4\\in \\{4,8\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $5\\in \\{2,3,5,7\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $6$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $7\\in \\{2,3,5,7\\}$\n\n- $8\\in \\{4,8\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $9$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $10$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\nThe elements $6,9,$ and $10$ are not yet contained within any of the given subsets. Therefore, the subset that must go in the blank is $\\{6,9,10\\}.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186371507 :answer-field/correct "answer-0c1615d1-6030-599d-aeec-a3e098b0f772" :answer-field/choices ["answer-59008d48-df74-5294-8d7b-477225578643" "answer-b34bdc7c-ae2a-5c5a-a2f1-547394871f6e" "answer-0c1615d1-6030-599d-aeec-a3e098b0f772" "answer-ecba50d7-df68-57d6-827a-9babc3cd9a74" "answer-ee3c953b-6c20-50a4-8eb5-a2a98b6cfbbc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-59008d48-df74-5294-8d7b-477225578643" :answer/id #uuid "5900