$-3\\in \\{-3,1,9\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $-2\\in \\{-4,-2,8\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $-1$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $0\\in \\{0,2,4\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $1\\in \\{-3,1,9\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $2\\in \\{0,2,4\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $3$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $4\\in \\{0,2,4\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $5\\in \\{5,6\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $6\\in \\{5,6\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $7$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $8\\in \\{-4,-2,8\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $9\\in \\{-3,1,9\\}\\,✓$\n\nThe elements $-1,$ $3,$ and $7$ are not yet contained within any of the given subsets. Therefore, the subset that must go in the blank is $\\{-1,3,7\\}.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186380105 :answer-field/correct "answer-0503c001-cdde-5d06-ac99-1fda34be3090" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0503c001-cdde-5d06-ac99-1fda34be3090" "answer-90f5903b-f962-5aa9-ba3a-2a842ddde890" "answer-0a0fb61c-1660-5cea-bc2e-ab7becbaa61a" "answer-81870caa-78f9-5447-ac80-1bc04c90214b" "answer-480c5f45-161a-509c-895b-9503b331c2bc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0503c001-cdde-5d06-ac99-1fda34be3090" :answer/id #uuid "0503c001-cdde-5d06-ac99-1fda34be3090" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-1,3,7\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-90f5903b-f962-5aa9-ba3a-2a842ddde890" :answer/id #uuid "90f5903b-f962-5aa9-ba3a-2a842ddde890" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-1,3\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0a0fb61c-1660-5cea-bc2e-ab7becbaa61a" :answer/id #uuid "0a0fb61c-1660-5cea-bc2e-ab7becbaa61a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-3,-1,7\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-81870caa-78f9-5447-ac80-1bc04c90214b" :answer/id #uuid "81870caa-78f9-5447-ac80-1bc04c90214b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-3,1\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-480c5f45-161a-509c-895b-9503b331c2bc" :answer/id #uuid "480c5f45-161a-509c-895b-9503b331c2bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{3,7\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-02edf3be-ceb4-5ec2-9b2d-055ba7ee8cb0" :question/id #uuid "02edf3be-ceb4-5ec2-9b2d-055ba7ee8cb0" :question/math-academy-id "q-81126" :question/problem "Consider the set $D=\\{f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m\\}.$ Which subset must be placed into the blank in the set below so that it represents a partition of $D?$\n\n$$\n\\{\\{f,h\\},\\{j,l\\},\\{k,m\\},\\,____\\,\\}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $D$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $D$ where every element of $D$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nTo find the subset that goes in the blank, we must identify which elements of $D$ are not yet contained within any of the given subsets.\n\nLet's go through each element of $D$ and check:\n\n- $f\\in \\{f,h\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $g$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $h\\in \\{f,h\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $i$ does not belong to any of the given subsets $\\,\\times $\n\n- $j\\in \\{j,l\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $k\\in \\{k,m\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $l\\in \\{j,l\\}\\,✓$\n\n- $m\\in \\{k,m\\}\\,✓$\n\nThe elements $g$ and $i$ are not yet contained within any of the given subsets. Therefore, the subset that must go in the blank is $\\{g,i\\}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-385fed83-46ac-5482-875a-c99e7ac9b428"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-385fed83-46ac-5482-875a-c99e7ac9b428" :answer-field/id #uuid "385fed83-46ac-5482-875a-c99e7ac9b428" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-68ff0240-a0e3-50f1-b425-dbbe604c8e23" :answer-field/choices ["answer-68ff0240-a0e3-50f1-b425-dbbe604c8e23" "answer-05c0d753-8d27-5acc-bd20-e6237b7c9d8f" "answer-77924205-ba87-507c-9700-d7fd9136acc2" "answer-c1966a72-d89e-5120-8b3a-05a0a98c904b" "answer-95b3929c-f039-5a57-9e6b-36ad5c05aaa2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-68ff0240-a0e3-50f1-b425-dbbe604c8e23" :answer/id #uuid "68ff0240-a0e3-50f1-b425-dbbe604c8e23" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{g,i\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-05c0d753-8d27-5acc-bd20-e6237b7c9d8f" :answer/id #uuid "05c0d753-8d27-5acc-bd20-e6237b7c9d8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{g,l\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-77924205-ba87-507c-9700-d7fd9136acc2" :answer/id #uuid "77924205-ba87-507c-9700-d7fd9136acc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{g,m\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c1966a72-d89e-5120-8b3a-05a0a98c904b" :answer/id #uuid "c1966a72-d89e-5120-8b3a-05a0a98c904b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{h,i\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-95b3929c-f039-5a57-9e6b-36ad5c05aaa2" :answer/id #uuid "95b3929c-f039-5a57-9e6b-36ad5c05aaa2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{h,l\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-69b3d845-cb50-5bee-8ad8-54f716adfbde" :question/id #uuid "69b3d845-cb50-5bee-8ad8-54f716adfbde" :question/math-academy-id "q-81135" :question/problem "If $C=\\{20,25,30,35,40,45\\},$ which collection of subsets of $C$ is a partition of $C?$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $C$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $C$ where every element of $C$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only $\\{\\{20\\},\\{25,30\\},\\{35,40,45\\}\\}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- $\\{∅,\\{20\\},\\{25,30\\},\\{35,40,45\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- $\\{\\{20,25,30\\},\\{25,35,40,45\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $25$ appears in two subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{20,30\\},\\{25,35,30\\},\\{20,30,40,45\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the elements $20$ and $30$ appear in multiple subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{20,25,30,35,45\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $40\\in C$ does not appear in any subset." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-da884869-66ab-5118-bbfc-80286e4e4e43"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-da884869-66ab-5118-bbfc-80286e4e4e43" :answer-field/id #uuid "da884869-66ab-5118-bbfc-80286e4e4e43" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7ca907f4-ab6c-5d5a-997f-cedab40f0e8b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-99264a47-d438-5e46-99e8-6e3cd1b786dc" "answer-8a0d418c-9540-5614-b34b-abed48184bb3" "answer-fe4aecfa-d65d-5039-a108-21509de8791e" "answer-7ca907f4-ab6c-5d5a-997f-cedab40f0e8b" "answer-5747f41d-230f-5c64-bbf5-407475003b8a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-99264a47-d438-5e46-99e8-6e3cd1b786dc" :answer/id #uuid "99264a47-d438-5e46-99e8-6e3cd1b786dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{20,25,30,35,45\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8a0d418c-9540-5614-b34b-abed48184bb3" :answer/id #uuid "8a0d418c-9540-5614-b34b-abed48184bb3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{20,25,30\\},\\{25,35,40,45\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fe4aecfa-d65d-5039-a108-21509de8791e" :answer/id #uuid "fe4aecfa-d65d-5039-a108-21509de8791e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{20,30\\},\\{25,35,30\\},\\{20,30,40,45\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7ca907f4-ab6c-5d5a-997f-cedab40f0e8b" :answer/id #uuid "7ca907f4-ab6c-5d5a-997f-cedab40f0e8b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{20\\},\\{25,30\\},\\{35,40,45\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5747f41d-230f-5c64-bbf5-407475003b8a" :answer/id #uuid "5747f41d-230f-5c64-bbf5-407475003b8a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{∅,\\{20\\},\\{25,30\\},\\{35,40,45\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186417776 :question/problem "If $B=\\{-2,-1,0,1,2\\}$, which collection of subsets of $B$ is a partition of $B?$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $B$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $B$ where every element of $B$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only $\\{\\{-2,0\\},\\{-1,1\\},\\{2\\}\\}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- $\\{\\{-2,-1\\},\\{-1,1\\},\\{0\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $-1$ appears in two subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{-2,-1\\},\\{-1,0\\},\\{1,2\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $-1$ appears in two subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{-2,-1,0\\},\\{-2,2\\},\\{-2,1\\},\\{-1,0\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the elements $-2,$ $-1$ and $0$ appear in multiple subsets.\n\n- $\\{∅,\\{-2,-1\\},\\{0,1,2\\}\\}$  is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186417773 :answer-field/correct "answer-9748f50c-5647-5d5e-9e0f-a158875d7f00" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e919aacf-dea4-501f-8011-a0194d2623c2" "answer-90833dac-b8c2-56dd-8766-a7ba68594a80" "answer-1d44e59f-200c-5c35-bd87-7f6c362b8c9b" "answer-9748f50c-5647-5d5e-9e0f-a158875d7f00" "answer-1ee58b09-fe58-571a-bb81-5e5880123a06"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e919aacf-dea4-501f-8011-a0194d2623c2" :answer/id #uuid "e919aacf-dea4-501f-8011-a0194d2623c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{-2,-1,0\\},\\{-2,2\\},\\{-2,1\\},\\{-1,0\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-90833dac-b8c2-56dd-8766-a7ba68594a80" :answer/id #uuid "90833dac-b8c2-56dd-8766-a7ba68594a80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{-2,-1\\},\\{-1,0\\},\\{1,2\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1d44e59f-200c-5c35-bd87-7f6c362b8c9b" :answer/id #uuid "1d44e59f-200c-5c35-bd87-7f6c362b8c9b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{-2,-1\\},\\{-1,1\\},\\{0\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9748f50c-5647-5d5e-9e0f-a158875d7f00" :answer/id #uuid "9748f50c-5647-5d5e-9e0f-a158875d7f00" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{-2,0\\},\\{-1,1\\},\\{2\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1ee58b09-fe58-571a-bb81-5e5880123a06" :answer/id #uuid "1ee58b09-fe58-571a-bb81-5e5880123a06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{∅,\\{-2,-1\\},\\{0,1,2\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186417775 :question/problem "If $T=\\{0,2,4,6,8,10\\}$, which collection of subsets of $T$ is a partition of $T?$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $T$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $T$ where every element of $T$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only $\\{\\{0,10\\},\\{2,4,6,8\\}\\}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- $\\{∅,\\{0,2,4,6,8\\},\\{10\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- $\\{\\{0,2,4,6,8,10,12\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $12$ does not appear in $T.$\n\n- $\\{\\{0,10\\},\\{2\\},\\{4,8\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $6\\in T$ does not appear in any subset.\n\n- $\\{\\{0,10\\},\\{2,4,6,8,10\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $10$ appears in two subsets." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186417770 :answer-field/correct "answer-704abcbb-66b9-523f-8075-50f9a4a8256e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ae1a3d01-2cd6-5dd9-89b9-88a328e0be94" "answer-704abcbb-66b9-523f-8075-50f9a4a8256e" "answer-f914fa50-6ac0-566e-b1a1-d5f660016346" "answer-dcb8ade0-cb28-5bda-9bc7-ef18d90e2205" "answer-ee2438de-047c-5102-97a9-b54926d28ef0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ae1a3d01-2cd6-5dd9-89b9-88a328e0be94" :answer/id #uuid "ae1a3d01-2cd6-5dd9-89b9-88a328e0be94" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{0,10\\},\\{2,4,6,8,10\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-704abcbb-66b9-523f-8075-50f9a4a8256e" :answer/id #uuid "704abcbb-66b9-523f-8075-50f9a4a8256e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{0,10\\},\\{2,4,6,8\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f914fa50-6ac0-566e-b1a1-d5f660016346" :answer/id #uuid "f914fa50-6ac0-566e-b1a1-d5f660016346" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{0,10\\},\\{2\\},\\{4,8,10\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dcb8ade0-cb28-5bda-9bc7-ef18d90e2205" :answer/id #uuid "dcb8ade0-cb28-5bda-9bc7-ef18d90e2205" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{0,2,4,6,8,10,12\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee2438de-047c-5102-97a9-b54926d28ef0" :answer/id #uuid "ee2438de-047c-5102-97a9-b54926d28ef0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{∅,\\{0,2,4,6,8\\},\\{10\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-8afb16b8-8920-5866-a36e-a4bdbe7d0e84" :question/id #uuid "8afb16b8-8920-5866-a36e-a4bdbe7d0e84" :question/math-academy-id "q-1278" :question/problem "If $A=\\{p,q,r,s,t\\}$, which collection of subsets of $A$ is a partition of $A?$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $A$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $A$ where every element of $A$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only $\\{\\{p,r,t\\},\\{q,s\\}\\}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- $\\{\\{p,q\\},\\{q,r\\},\\{s,t\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $q$ appears in two subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{p,t\\},\\{q,r\\},\\{p,s\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $p$ appears in two subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{p,q\\},\\{p,q,r,s\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $t\\in A$ does not appear in any subset and the elements $p,$ $q$ appear in multiple subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{p,q,r\\},\\{t\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $s\\in A$ does not appear in any subset." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-194e5e96-bf95-52c2-9112-d498e3464c7a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-194e5e96-bf95-52c2-9112-d498e3464c7a" :answer-field/id #uuid "194e5e96-bf95-52c2-9112-d498e3464c7a" :answer-field/key "sel