ecause the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- $\\{∅,\\{t\\},\\{u,v,w\\},\\{x,y,z\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- $\\{\\{t,u,v\\},\\{v,w\\},\\{v,w,x,y,z\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $v$ appears in three subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{t,u,v\\},\\{y,z\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the elements $w$ and $x$ do not appear in any subsets." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186056460 :answer-field/correct "answer-202197b8-6a0c-5196-bd0e-fc9053417f63" :answer-field/choices ["answer-5a590642-ec63-5d09-bda0-bf41e2412aec" "answer-202197b8-6a0c-5196-bd0e-fc9053417f63" "answer-2a14a308-531e-54d3-be88-c5fe9f7197bb" "answer-a3fd1faf-d498-5c38-a870-170ad0265a92" "answer-0cefe5a6-b32f-567c-bafc-768391f23c9f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5a590642-ec63-5d09-bda0-bf41e2412aec" :answer/id #uuid "5a590642-ec63-5d09-bda0-bf41e2412aec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{t,u,v\\},\\{v,w\\},\\{v,w,x,y,z\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-202197b8-6a0c-5196-bd0e-fc9053417f63" :answer/id #uuid "202197b8-6a0c-5196-bd0e-fc9053417f63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{t,u,v\\},\\{w\\},\\{x,y,z\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2a14a308-531e-54d3-be88-c5fe9f7197bb" :answer/id #uuid "2a14a308-531e-54d3-be88-c5fe9f7197bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{t,u,v\\},\\{y,z\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a3fd1faf-d498-5c38-a870-170ad0265a92" :answer/id #uuid "a3fd1faf-d498-5c38-a870-170ad0265a92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{∅,\\{t,u,v,w\\},\\{x,y,z\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0cefe5a6-b32f-567c-bafc-768391f23c9f" :answer/id #uuid "0cefe5a6-b32f-567c-bafc-768391f23c9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{∅,\\{t\\},\\{u,v,w\\},\\{x,y,z\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186397829 :question/problem "If $A=\\{0,10,20,…,900\\},$ which collection of subsets of $A$ is a partition of $A?$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $A$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $A$ where every element of $A$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only $\\{\\{0\\},\\{10,20,30,…,900\\}\\}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- $\\{∅,\\{0,10,20,…,900\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- $\\{\\{10,30,50…,890\\},\\{20,40,60,…,900\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the element $0$ does not appear in any subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{0,10,20,…,890\\}\\},\\{20,40,60,…,900\\}\\}$ is not a partition because it contains many elements, such as $20,40,60,…,900,$ that appear in multiple subsets.\n\n- $\\{\\{10,30,50…,890\\}\\},\\{0,20,40,60,…,800\\}\\}$ is not a partition because the elements $820,840…,900$ do not appear in any subsets." :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186397830 :answer-field/correct "answer-32b815fe-323f-503b-863a-27153eac4991" :answer-field/choices ["answer-994eba30-58d2-53ae-b6dc-0d1abdd12e16" "answer-32b815fe-323f-503b-863a-27153eac4991" "answer-232a6a6f-ba90-58cf-914e-bc1ac4531633" "answer-602b55fc-6561-57c0-978c-d67e5ac48e50" "answer-9b9f41d1-f08b-535f-aa15-64b0fad64979"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-994eba30-58d2-53ae-b6dc-0d1abdd12e16" :answer/id #uuid "994eba30-58d2-53ae-b6dc-0d1abdd12e16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{0,10,20,…,890\\},\\{20,40,60,…,900\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-32b815fe-323f-503b-863a-27153eac4991" :answer/id #uuid "32b815fe-323f-503b-863a-27153eac4991" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{0\\},\\{10,20,30,…,900\\}\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-232a6a6f-ba90-58cf-914e-bc1ac4531633" :answer/id #uuid "232a6a6f-ba90-58cf-914e-bc1ac4531633" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{\\{10,30,50…,890\\},\\{0,20,40,60,…,800\\}\\}" :db/en